---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: About Us
permalink: /about/
pageId: about
pageCss: about
---
<section class="page-hero page-hero--plain" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="page-hero__inner">
    <h1 class="page-hero__title" id="about-title">About us</h1>
    <p class="page-hero__lede rise" style="--d:180ms">We are a Toronto charity that partners with community dental clinics across the city, where volunteer dentists and hygienists give affordable urgent care to people with nowhere else to turn.</p>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--light mvg" aria-label="Mission, vision and goals">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="cards">
      <article class="card mvg__card" data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow">Our mission</p>
        <p>Affordable urgent dental care, through volunteer dentists, for low-income Torontonians who have nowhere else to turn.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card mvg__card" data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow">Our vision</p>
        <p>A Toronto where everyone has equal access to oral health care and the opportunity to achieve overall well-being.</p>
      </article>
      <article class="card mvg__card" data-reveal>
        <p class="eyebrow">Our goals</p>
        <p>Close gaps in access with timely, affordable urgent treatment, reduce oral health inequities, and connect underserved Torontonians with the care and support they need.</p>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--navy" aria-labelledby="impact-title">
  <div class="container" data-reveal>
    <h2 class="eyebrow" id="impact-title">Our 2025 impact</h2>
    {% set items = widgets['about:0fb7c4e'].items %}{% include "partials/counters.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--grey quote">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="split quote__split" data-reveal>
      <img class="quote__logo" src="{{ '/assets/img/FTG-logo-blue-.webp' | url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">
      <blockquote class="quote__text">
        <p class="quote__lead">Despite the introduction of the Canadian Dental Care Plan, many people still fall through the cracks.</p>
        <p>Navigating the complex landscape of public benefits and dental coverage can leave many Torontonians without access to the care they need. We are here to help bridge those gaps and guide individuals toward better oral health.</p>
      </blockquote>
    </div>
    <div class="quote__video" data-reveal>
      <div class="video" data-video="-N31J6L3qJU">
        <button class="video__play" type="button" aria-label="Play video"><img src="https://i.ytimg.com/vi/-N31J6L3qJU/hqdefault.jpg" alt="" loading="lazy"><span class="video__icon" aria-hidden="true"></span></button>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--light story" aria-labelledby="story-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="band__head" data-reveal><h2 class="band__title" id="story-title">Our Story</h2></header>
    <div class="split" data-reveal>
      <img class="split__img" src="{{ '/assets/img/volunteers.webp' | url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">
      <div class="copy story__text">
        <p class="story__year">2007</p>
        <p class="story__lead">It all started in 2007 with a donated dental chair and a dental assistant in Scarborough, Toronto.</p>
        <p>A coalition of community partners had recognized the need to help the growing number of Torontonians who suffer with debilitating tooth pain and infection without having anywhere to turn for dental care due to gaps that exist in the Canadian healthcare system. This joint venture was called Filling the Gap Scarborough.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="split story__flip" data-reveal>
      <img class="split__img" src="{{ '/assets/img/IMG_0532-e1689078889860.webp' | url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">
      <div class="copy story__text">
        <p class="story__year">2017</p>
        <p>The program expanded in 2017, relocating to a larger space alongside our partners, the Canadian Centre for Refugee and Immigrant Healthcare, and adding three dental chairs. Volunteer dentists and hygienists provided vital services to patients unable to access care through private or government plans.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="split" data-reveal>
      <img class="split__img" src="{{ '/assets/img/ops.webp' | url }}" alt="" loading="lazy">
      <div class="copy story__text">
        <p class="story__year">2020</p>
        <p>In 2020, Filling the Gap Dental Outreach was established as a certified charity and a second clinic was opened in partnership with the Rexdale Hub Community Health Centre in the GTA in order to reach more people in need.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--grey team" aria-labelledby="team-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="band__head" data-reveal><h2 class="band__title" id="team-title">Our Team</h2></header>
    <img class="team__collage" src="{{ '/assets/img/collage-ftg-2-e1689937937420.webp' | url }}" alt="" loading="lazy" data-reveal>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--light board" aria-labelledby="board-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="band__head" data-reveal><h2 class="band__title" id="board-title">Our Board</h2></header>
    {% set items = widgets['about:d50a38b'].items %}{% set prefix = 'board' %}{% include "partials/adv-accordion.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--grey pubs" aria-labelledby="pubs-title">
  <div class="container">
    <header class="band__head" data-reveal><h2 class="band__title" id="pubs-title">Featured Publications</h2></header>
    <div class="htabs pubs__tabs" data-tabs>
      <div class="htabs__list" role="tablist" aria-label="Featured publications">
        {% for t in widgets['about:367f1e67'].items %}
        <button class="htabs__tab{% if loop.first %} is-active{% endif %}" role="tab" id="pub-tab-{{ loop.index }}" aria-controls="pub-panel-{{ loop.index }}" aria-selected="{{ 'true' if loop.first else 'false' }}" tabindex="{{ '0' if loop.first else '-1' }}">{{ t.title }}</button>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
      <div class="htabs__panels">
        {% for t in widgets['about:367f1e67'].items %}
        <div class="htabs__panel{% if loop.first %} is-active{% endif %}" role="tabpanel" id="pub-panel-{{ loop.index }}" aria-labelledby="pub-tab-{{ loop.index }}"{% if not loop.first %} hidden{% endif %}>{{ t.html | html | safe }}</div>
        {% endfor %}
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
